**Definition 3.1 (natural views).** For an actual prefix $h$ of the
incidence run define separately:

| View | Independent meaning | Canonical body |
| --- | --- | --- |
| $S(h)$ | Root-relative L/R child support of the actual storage tree. | CYCLE Definition 3.3's preorder two-bit child masks. |
| $B(h)$ | Actual root paths whose two child slots are empty. | CYCLE Definition 3.4's contour of that terminal antichain. |
| $T(h)$ | Actual ordered $\Pi_{\mathrm{gc}}$ patch occurrences from the paid entrance, including operands, probes, updates, births, head changes, labels and receipts. | CYCLE Definition 5.3's eleven-field chronological records. |
| $M_J(h)$ | UAS's selected actual retained backing, construction relations, frontier and current rights. | CYCLE Definition 6.1's seven-family records, with the role directory of Definition 2.2. |

Support and terminality concern child incidence, process order concerns
reaction occurrence, and memory concerns existing resources and relations.
They are not defined by $Q$, a manifest, an Image, $k$, a completed list or
four copies of a transcript. In particular joint memory can include
producer/input-owner material that A cannot currently read. Its body is
produced from an acquired representation, not by probing that material.

For clarity the seven memory families are: (0) actual acquired seed and
its delivery/boot binding; (1) constructed initial code/69 prefix and
finite installation fields; (2) actual13 ingress and17 dependencies,
including partial/preallocated material; (3) actual70 ingress and68
descriptors, including the separate mode block; (4) actual input frontier,
relevant raw scratch, PC/version/roles and the occupied input latch;
(5) actual71/73 callable backing, copies and invocation/read/mailbox
relations, including partial unavailable objects; (6) actual meter and
selected current rights. Cells are identified by port and creation
position; repeated references retain identity. Descriptors of CAP and
RCA keep their distinct grammars and ordinal conventions.

